"""Manual full-source assessments for concrete transport/custody seams."""
import json,pathlib
H=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parent;P='additional_pfp_infrastructure_remaining';p=H/(P+'_notes.json');n=json.loads(p.read_text())if p.exists()else{}
rows={
241:('Full native sandbox adapter read. Enforces positive exact-integer limits and nonempty argument strings, refuses native unavailability without raw-process fallback, validates native outcome field sets, bounds output, compares observed raw bytes and memory readbacks.','Actual isolation/resource enforcement remains native-host responsibility. Observation isolation_applied is type-checked but not required true on Completed; completed timeout/memory values are not independently compared to requested limits. No native process was launched.'),
244:('Full Anthropic native transport and replay adapter read. Absolute retained path,16MiB byte bound and exact digest/length checks protect replay custody; replay requires replayed true and zero provider calls. Sending delegates quote/cost/raw retention to native provider owner without Python retries.','Caller trusts native envelope shape; some malformed envelopes raise rather than return typed refusal. Retained path is caller-selected, not root-confined. Native behavior/prices are not validated by the adapter docstring; no key or provider was accessed.'),
245:('Full retired raw OpenRouter sender read. Public call always raises LEGACY_SEAT_TRANSPORT_RETIRED; old configuration remains inspectable and constructor still creates the legacy gateway object.','No live execution path in this class and no constructor invoked. Imported gateway constructor side effects/credential discovery belong to its owner; a retired execution guard alone does not prove construction is effect-free.'),
247:('Full transport protocol and scripted adapter read. Acceptance tests protocol_id and class module prefix; scripted transport invokes its supplied callable directly.','This is cooperative type/convention screening, not a security boundary: protocol/module labels are mutable/spoofable, and the no-model requirement on scripted callbacks is prose only. No callback executed.'),
233:('Full provider adapters read. SeedHostVerifier grades actual Stage4 candidate and each challenge witness, compares witness/candidate canonical JSON, rejects unavailable checker as a refusal oracle and checks no probe mutation. Offline completions are labeled shape fixtures and refuse unavailable seed witnesses. Live facade requires accounted gateway, one attempt, nullable cost and stops pending settlement.','Seed-specific checker adequacy remains an admitted dependency. Concrete witness evaluation strengthens the generic application Stage7 return-label guard without proving arbitrary injected verifier behavior. Gateway initialization/preflight identity and all math/provider evidence were source-reviewed only.'),
203:('Full retired seat executor plus private historical fixture path read. Public execute always refuses. Historical path records unknown failures with retained estimated charge, checks authority metadata and keeps explicit overshoot/price-table source fields; one machine block required.','Private fixture is not a supported live route. Append-only ledger lacks locking and parser permits duplicate machine keys/other undeclared field values; optional admission output reservation is deliberately lower than actual cap. These are historical limitations, not asserted active dispatch defects.'),
246:('Full routing DTO/native seam read. Exact Fraction prices serialize as rational strings; routing validation, cost, share and spend delegate to named native operations. BudgetPolicy explicitly distinguishes strict max-token reservation from an optional overshoot-permitting reserve.','DTO constructors perform no local invariants; native reply envelope and returned seat identity are trusted. Distinct vendor names and supplied prices do not prove model independence or maximum vendor liability. No native call occurred.'),
213:('Full pilot gateway composition and reply boundary read. Requires known accounted gateway types, model/provider/output match and continuing shared ledger/call allowance across models; binds task/attempt input and response envelope before exposing answer. Retains raw provider bytes and nullable usage on failures.','Shape binding is explicitly not original-judge acceptance. OpenRouter CompletedPendingSettlement is locally accepted, while the higher live-provider facade overrides it to stop; concrete other consumers need tracing. Provider error strings/claims remain adapter-trusted and broad exceptions return an error record.'),
254:('Full prepared task-turn wrapper read. Binds task/input/attempt/checker labels, hashes retained reply bytes and reruns checking on replay; lone-surrogate content is retained with labeled surrogatepass bytes for strict refusal. Unsettled cost errors retain candidate, provider wire and attempt state.','Transport/accounting and actual judges remain caller-owned. The checker string ID is not its source/body proof. Replay decodes unbounded caller base64 before checking digest; frozen dataclass contains mutable metadata/underlying values. No provider or checker execution.'),
}
